select app.guide_release_section('owner', 'notices-profile-and-leaving', 'chapter', 'for-partner-rental-companies', 'Keep your details up to date, read our notices, and know how to take a car out of the program.

## Notifications

1. Account > Notifications lists our messages: new bookings, changes to a booking, payments and listing news, with your email preferences beside them.
2. Press **Mark as read** on one, or **Mark all as read**.

![](/guides/img/owner-14-notifications-desktop-8e58b95e.jpg "desktop; size: 1440 692; address: carmacars.ca/owner/notifications; pins: 2 20.1 22.7")

## Your profile

1. Update your email, phone and address, then press Save.
2. On your agreements shows your legal name and how you are enrolled. A change to these means new agreements, so call or message us.

![](/guides/img/owner-15-profile-desktop-874dd23d.jpg "desktop; size: 1440 872; address: carmacars.ca/owner/profile; pins: 1 12.2 84.7, 2 73.4 21.2")

## Texts or email

On **Account** > **Profile**, under **Messages**, choose **Email**, **Text** or **Both**: new bookings, payouts, invoices and documents to sign by a short text with a link. Texts need a phone you verified with a code. Statements, invoices and signed documents are always emailed too. Reply STOP to any text to stop them.

## Take a car out of the program

You give 30 days'' notice for that car only. Your other cars stay in.

1. Open Cars and the car. Read Leaving: when the notice ends and what happens to your last fees.
2. Press **Give notice**. Add a Reason (optional).
3. Press **Give exit notice**. The car''s page then shows its exit date.

## Phone alerts

Get an alert on your phone or computer when one of your cars is booked, when a booking changes, for payouts and payments, incidents and documents to sign.

1. Open **Account** > **Profile**. Under **Phone alerts**, press **Turn on alerts** and allow notifications when your browser asks.
2. Under **What to alert me about**, choose the topics. Your choice applies to all your devices.
3. **Send a test alert** shows one. **Turn off on this device** stops them there; **Remove** takes another device off.

Once your application is approved, your portal asks once whether to turn alerts on: press **Turn on**, or **Not now** (it is not asked again until a later approval). On a phone, once the CarmaCars app is in the stores, the invitation offers **Download the CarmaCars app** instead.

On iPhone and iPad, add CarmaCars to your Home Screen first (Safari, **Share**, **Add to Home Screen**), then open it from there and turn alerts on. Alerts that are not urgent wait until 8 am.

## Delete my account

**Profile**, **Delete my account**, then **Yes, delete my account**. We settle your cars, payouts and invoices first (a car under your agreement leaves the program with 30 days'' notice), then delete your account and email you. **Keep my account** withdraws the request. Agreements, statements and tax records are kept as the law requires.', 'Notices, profile and leaving', 'Notifications, your profile and giving an exit notice.',
  'Keep your details up to date, read our notices, and know how to take a car out of the program.

## Notifications

1. Account > Notifications lists our messages: new bookings, changes to a booking, payments and listing news, with your email preferences beside them.
2. Press **Mark as read** on one, or **Mark all as read**.

![](/guides/img/owner-14-notifications-desktop-8e58b95e.jpg "desktop; size: 1440 692; address: carmacars.ca/owner/notifications; pins: 2 20.1 22.7")

## Your profile

1. Update your phone and address, then press Save. To change the email you sign in with, press **Change my email** under Sign-in: type the new address, open the link we send to it (the old address is told too), and your email changes everywhere.
2. On your agreements shows your legal name and how you are enrolled. A change to these means new agreements, so call or message us.

![](/guides/img/owner-15-profile-desktop-874dd23d.jpg "desktop; size: 1440 872; address: carmacars.ca/owner/profile; pins: 1 12.2 84.7, 2 73.4 21.2")

## Texts or email

On **Account** > **Profile**, under **Messages**, choose **Email**, **Text** or **Both**: new bookings, payouts, invoices and documents to sign by a short text with a link. Texts need a phone you verified with a code. Statements, invoices and signed documents are always emailed too. Reply STOP to any text to stop them.

## Take a car out of the program

You give 30 days'' notice for that car only. Your other cars stay in.

1. Open Cars and the car. Read Leaving: when the notice ends and what happens to your last fees.
2. Press **Give notice**. Add a Reason (optional).
3. Press **Give exit notice**. The car''s page then shows its exit date.

## Phone alerts

Get an alert on your phone or computer when one of your cars is booked, when a booking changes, for payouts and payments, incidents and documents to sign.

1. Open **Account** > **Profile**. Under **Phone alerts**, press **Turn on alerts** and allow notifications when your browser asks.
2. Under **What to alert me about**, choose the topics. Your choice applies to all your devices.
3. **Send a test alert** shows one. **Turn off on this device** stops them there; **Remove** takes another device off.

Once your application is approved, your portal asks once whether to turn alerts on: press **Turn on**, or **Not now** (it is not asked again until a later approval). On a phone, once the CarmaCars app is in the stores, the invitation offers **Download the CarmaCars app** instead.

On iPhone and iPad, add CarmaCars to your Home Screen first (Safari, **Share**, **Add to Home Screen**), then open it from there and turn alerts on. Alerts that are not urgent wait until 8 am.

## Delete my account

**Profile**, **Delete my account**, then **Yes, delete my account**. We settle your cars, payouts and invoices first (a car under your agreement leaves the program with 30 days'' notice), then delete your account and email you. **Keep my account** withdraws the request. Agreements, statements and tax records are kept as the law requires.',
  '<p class="gd-p">Keep your details up to date, read our notices, and know how to take a car out of the program.</p><section class="gd-task" id="notices-profile-and-leaving-notifications" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Notifications</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Account &gt; Notifications lists our messages: new bookings, changes to a booking, payments and listing news, with your email preferences beside them.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Mark as read</b> on one, or <b class="gd-ui">Mark all as read</b>.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/owner/notifications</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1440/692"><img src="/guides/img/owner-14-notifications-desktop-8e58b95e.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1440" height="692"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:20.1%;top:22.7%" aria-hidden="true">2</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="notices-profile-and-leaving-your-profile" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Your profile</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Update your phone and address, then press Save. To change the email you sign in with, press <b class="gd-ui">Change my email</b> under Sign-in: type the new address, open the link we send to it (the old address is told too), and your email changes everywhere.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">On your agreements shows your legal name and how you are enrolled. A change to these means new agreements, so call or message us.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/owner/profile</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1440/872"><img src="/guides/img/owner-15-profile-desktop-874dd23d.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1440" height="872"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:12.2%;top:84.7%" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:73.4%;top:21.2%" aria-hidden="true">2</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="notices-profile-and-leaving-texts-or-email" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Texts or email</h2><p class="gd-p">On <b class="gd-ui">Account</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Profile</b>, under <b class="gd-ui">Messages</b>, choose <b class="gd-ui">Email</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Text</b> or <b class="gd-ui">Both</b>: new bookings, payouts, invoices and documents to sign by a short text with a link. Texts need a phone you verified with a code. Statements, invoices and signed documents are always emailed too. Reply STOP to any text to stop them.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="notices-profile-and-leaving-take-a-car-out-of-the-program" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Take a car out of the program</h2><p class="gd-p">You give 30 days&#39; notice for that car only. Your other cars stay in.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open Cars and the car. Read Leaving: when the notice ends and what happens to your last fees.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Give notice</b>. Add a Reason (optional).</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Give exit notice</b>. The car&#39;s page then shows its exit date.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="notices-profile-and-leaving-phone-alerts" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Phone alerts</h2><p class="gd-p">Get an alert on your phone or computer when one of your cars is booked, when a booking changes, for payouts and payments, incidents and documents to sign.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open <b class="gd-ui">Account</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Profile</b>. Under <b class="gd-ui">Phone alerts</b>, press <b class="gd-ui">Turn on alerts</b> and allow notifications when your browser asks.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Under <b class="gd-ui">What to alert me about</b>, choose the topics. Your choice applies to all your devices.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">Send a test alert</b> shows one. <b class="gd-ui">Turn off on this device</b> stops them there; <b class="gd-ui">Remove</b> takes another device off.</div></li></ol></div><p class="gd-p">Once your application is approved, your portal asks once whether to turn alerts on: press <b class="gd-ui">Turn on</b>, or <b class="gd-ui">Not now</b> (it is not asked again until a later approval). On a phone, once the CarmaCars app is in the stores, the invitation offers <b class="gd-ui">Download the CarmaCars app</b> instead.</p><p class="gd-p">On iPhone and iPad, add CarmaCars to your Home Screen first (Safari, <b class="gd-ui">Share</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Add to Home Screen</b>), then open it from there and turn alerts on. Alerts that are not urgent wait until 8 am.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="notices-profile-and-leaving-delete-my-account" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Delete my account</h2><p class="gd-p"><b class="gd-ui">Profile</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Delete my account</b>, then <b class="gd-ui">Yes, delete my account</b>. We settle your cars, payouts and invoices first (a car under your agreement leaves the program with 30 days&#39; notice), then delete your account and email you. <b class="gd-ui">Keep my account</b> withdraws the request. Agreements, statements and tax records are kept as the law requires.</p></section>');
select app.guide_release_section('owner', 'quick-reference', 'reference', 'notices-profile-and-leaving', '### Where things are

| Item | What it is for |
| --- | --- |
| **Home** | The next thing to do first, then what you earned this month, cars out, the next payout and fees due, your cars and what is coming up |
| **Cars** | **Your cars** (each car: terms, checklist, uploads, photos, Leaving) and **Bookings** (all bookings, the calendar, Book my own car) |
| **Money** | **Statements** (this month so far, then one a month, Download PDF), **Payouts** (what was paid and when), **Invoices** (fee invoices and Pay $...) |
| **Documents** | Agreements, forms, Forms C and D |
| **Account** | **Profile** (contact details, password), **Banking** (automatic debit, where we pay you), **Notifications** (our messages) |

### Top tasks

1. *Sign everything at once:* **Home** > **Check and sign**
2. *Set up the monthly debit:* **Account** > **Banking** > **Set up pre-authorized debit**
3. *Pay an invoice now:* **Money** > **Invoices**, the invoice, then **Pay $...**
4. *Payout details:* **Account** > **Banking** > **Where we pay you**
5. *Forms C and D:* **Documents** > **Sign Form C on screen instead** or **Take a photo of the signed page**
6. *Book your own car:* **Cars** > **Bookings** > **Book my own car**
7. *New listing photos:* **Cars**, the car, then **Take new photos**
8. *Leave the program:* **Cars**, the car, then **Give notice**

### If something goes wrong

| What you see | What to do |
| --- | --- |
| **A link says it expired** | Links in our emails work for 24 hours, once. Press **Send me a new link** on that page. |
| **"Error 1102" on a page** | A short limit on our web host. Reload the page. You are still signed in. |
| **"That email and password do not match an account."** | Check the address, or use **Set a new password** on the sign-in page. |
| **A debit was returned** | You get an email with the reason. Insufficient funds: keep the money in the account for the retry, or pay the invoice from its page. Any other reason: pay from the invoice''s page or set up a new account under Account > Banking. |
', 'Quick reference', 'One page with the essentials.',
