![](/guides/img/admin-01-today-desktop-ea48309c.jpg "desktop; size: 1440 900; address: carmacars.ca/admin; pins: 1 22.9 65.0, 2 61.8 65.6, 5 76.4 56.1, 6 84.4 24.7, 7 58.3 37.8")

## The menu

Today and Bookings open to show their pages; Cars, People, Marketing, Money and Settings are one link each, which opens the area''s main page with a row of its pages on top. On a phone the whole menu sits behind one Menu button that says where you are.

| Menu | Pages (the row on top, then a page''s tabs) |
| --- | --- |
| Today | To do, Overview, Staff tasks, Visitors (tabs Live now, Chat, History) |
| Bookings | Trips: Bookings (Now and All bookings; Send an offer and Add a rental are its buttons), Requests and offers (with Chauffeur), Calendar. Customers: Reviews. Problems: Damage and claims (tabs Damage, Incidents, Claims) |
| Cars (opens on Vehicles) | Vehicles (tabs All cars, Fleet tracking, Calendar sync; Add a car, Rates for many cars and Retire or delete are buttons on All cars), Listings (tabs Listings, Similar cars), Maintenance |
| Money (opens on Payments, By day) | Payments (tabs By day, All payments, Refunds, Deposits, Disputes, Reconciliation), Owner money (tabs Invoices, Debits, Statements, Payouts), Tolls and tickets, Company (tabs Monthly statements, Company model, Expenses, Commissions, Field pay), Insurers (tabs Rates, Invoices) |
| People (opens on Owners, Applications) | Owners (tabs Applications, Owners, Owner forms, Paid and signed; Add a car for an owner is a button), Partners (tabs Rental partners, Referral partners), Renters (tabs Renters, Leads), Team (tabs Staff and roles, Academy, Hiring, Portals and view as), Investors |
| Marketing (opens on Marketplace) | Marketplace, Ads (tabs Ad listings, Posted ads, Social drafts), Channels (tabs Listing channels, Bookings by channel), Owner recruitment (tabs Recruitment, Owner pipeline) |
| Settings (opens on Settings) | Settings (every setting in six sections, with a search box), Logs (tabs Emails, Blocked addresses, Changes, Data access) |

![On a phone: press Menu (1), then a group (2), then the page (3).](/guides/img/admin-31-menu-phone-667dc2fd.jpg "phone; size: 390 715; pins: 1 10.3 28.7, 2 76.9 42.4, 3 76.9 48.3")

## Tabs on a page

A menu link such as **Money** opens a page with a row on top: the area''s name in capitals, then its pages (Payments, Owner money, Tolls and tickets...). The page you are on is black. A page with tabs (such as **Owner money**: Invoices, Debits, Statements, Payouts) has a second row under it, the tab you are on outlined in red. On a phone each row slides sideways.

1. Press a tab to change what the page shows. Each tab has its own address, so a link or a bookmark to a tab opens that tab.
2. An old address (an email or a bookmark from before November 2026, such as Owner invoices, the Audit log or Live chat) opens the page and the tab that now holds it. Each area lists at most five pages; a page that does one thing (Add a car, Send an offer) is a button on the page it belongs to.
3. Ctrl+K lists every tab and every such button too: type Debits, Field pay or Add a car and press Enter.

## Search

The search box sits at the top of the menu, on every page.

1. Type a booking number (CC-1042), a car code (CC-7F3A, on every car page and fleet card), a plate, a VIN, or a name or email address.
2. Press **Search** (or Enter). Results come in groups: bookings, cars, owners, partners and renters. Open one to go to its page.
3. The same box finds pages too: type a few letters (Payouts, Program settings) and the matching pages show above the records. Ctrl+K (Cmd+K on a Mac) or **/** puts you in the box from anywhere.

![](/guides/img/admin-32-search-desktop-ca548a70.jpg "desktop; size: 1440 420; address: carmacars.ca/admin/search?q=CC-10065; pins: 1 7.4 45.2, 2 95.0 46.9")

## Keyboard shortcuts

Press g, then a letter. Press / to jump to the search box, and Ctrl+K to jump to any page.

| Keys | Opens | Keys | Opens |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| g t | To do | g v | Cars (Vehicles) |
| g r | Requests | g o | People (Owners) |
| g b | Bookings | g m | Money (Payments) |
| g c | Calendar | g k | Staff tasks |
| g s | Settings | / | Search |
| Ctrl K | Search pages and records | Esc | Close it |

### Search everything from the header

The **Search** button at the top of every page (or press **/** or **Ctrl K**) finds pages, cars, places and guides, and your records: bookings and requests by number, renter name, email, phone or plate, renters, owners and cars. Arrows choose, **Enter** opens, **Esc** closes. Each person finds only what their role may open.

## Choose a portal

An account with more than one portal (Admin and the staff portal, an owner who also invests) opens **Choose a portal** after signing in: one card for each portal, with what is there and your role in it. The portal you opened last comes first, marked Last used.

> Good to know: An Admin account has no renter portal: My rentals is not offered, and `carmacars.ca/account` opens Admin. The renter profile and its bookings stay on file under **People** > **Renters**.',
  '<p class="gd-p">Admin opens on To do: the day&#39;s counts at the top, then what needs you now, most urgent first. The menu groups every screen into seven groups: Today, Bookings, Cars, People, Marketing, Money and Settings. Pages on one subject are one menu link with a row of tabs on top (for example Money &gt; Owner money: Invoices, Debits, Statements, Payouts). Search finds any booking, car or person, and Ctrl+K jumps to any page.</p><section class="gd-task" id="getting-around-admin-to-do" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">To do</h2><p class="gd-p">Start every shift here. Each line says what to do and why, and its button opens a small pop-up that does it, already filled in. Nothing to remember and no menu to search.</p><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Each piece of work is its own line (work of one kind for several cars is one line, such as Add real photos (72 cars); its button opens the list), marked Now, Today or When you can: a car the insurer has not confirmed, a car not on the site, a renter&#39;s documents to check, a visitor waiting in live chat, a booking request, a change a renter asked for, an owner application, an owner invoice waiting for payment, the first and last month an owner paid after their invoices were voided, the terms agreed with an owner still on the standard grid, documents an owner has not signed, an official form to check, a plate to check, a car showing sample photos, and any task of the Admin.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Press the line&#39;s button: Mark insured, Set rates and publish, Review documents, Record payment, Record what they paid, Enter the terms, Waiting to sign, Checked: use for owners, Open the chat, and so on. A line you do not need has Not needed or These are correct. The pop-up is filled in; check it and confirm. The line disappears once the work is done.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Under the lines, the counts with one button each (failed payments, agreements to countersign, tolls, listings, insurance, staff commissions, prices typed by hand, sales claims, Turo emails). A count with nothing waiting moves to the bottom, under &quot;more with nothing waiting&quot;.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">While no assistant holds customer service, sales, finance or fleet (the live verification&#39;s test accounts do not count), their tasks come to To do too, and so do their emails, to rent@carmacars.ca.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">5</span><div class="gd-t">Beside the list (under it on a phone): today&#39;s pickups (ready or not ready), today&#39;s returns (due or late) and today&#39;s chauffeur bookings, by time.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">6</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Overview</b> for the money, fleet and queue figures, the alerts and the team&#39;s sales for the month.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">7</span><div class="gd-t">The dark band at the top counts the day, each count one tap from its page: requests waiting (with how long the oldest has waited, red past the reply target), pickups and returns today, payments to chase, deposits to settle, staff tasks open and alerts. A count that needs you now is red and says so.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/admin</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1440/900"><img src="/guides/img/admin-01-today-desktop-ea48309c.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1440" height="900"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:22.9%;top:65%" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:61.8%;top:65.6%" aria-hidden="true">2</span><sp