> Tip: To change the email you sign in with, open Profile, Sign-in and press **Change my email**: type the new address, and we send a confirmation link to it and tell the old address. Your email changes only when the link is opened, and every record of yours follows it.',
  '<p class="gd-p">Every function has the calendar and Find a renter. Use them to answer questions fast.</p><section class="gd-task" id="shared-tools-the-calendar" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">The calendar</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Every car with its photo, its bookings, requests and blocks. The red line is now. Tap a bar for its details; on a phone it opens on the agenda, by day.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Use the arrows, Today and the range to move around, or search by plate, booking or name.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Fleet and customer service can remove a cleaning block from its side panel (<b class="gd-ui">Remove the block</b>) when a car is ready sooner.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/va/calendar</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1230/800"><img src="/guides/img/va-cs-09-calendar-desktop-541a6da5.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1230" height="800"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:60.2%;top:33.8%" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:28.5%;top:17.5%" aria-hidden="true">2</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="shared-tools-find-a-car" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Find a car</h2><p class="gd-p"><b class="gd-ui">Bookings</b>, the <b class="gd-ui">Find a car</b> tab. A renter quotes the car code on the car&#39;s page (like CC-7F3A).</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Type the car code, a plate, a VIN or the name. Each car shows its code, plate, status and its page on the site.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">In Add a rental, type the car code or plate in the box above Car to choose it.</div></li></ol></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="shared-tools-find-a-renter" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Find a renter</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Search by name, email, phone or booking number.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Opening a renter&#39;s private details asks for a reason (<b class="gd-ui">Open with a reason</b>). It is kept in the access log.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/va/renters</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1230/240"><img src="/guides/img/va-cs-07-renters-desktop-99cfd0ef.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1230" height="240"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:68.3%;top:34.6%" aria-hidden="true">1</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="shared-tools-email-the-renter" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Email the renter</h2><p class="gd-p">Customer service, Sales, Fleet and Finance can all write to the renter from a booking: press <b class="gd-ui">Email the renter</b>, or open the <b class="gd-ui">Messages &amp; history</b> section.</p><p class="gd-p">The booking page, the car page and the listing review are the same pages an Admin opens. The car page has the Admin&#39;s tabs your function uses: <b class="gd-ui">Overview</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Rates &amp; fees</b> and <b class="gd-ui">Maintenance</b> (Fleet), <b class="gd-ui">Listing</b> and <b class="gd-ui">Documents</b>; an old link to a car&#39;s maintenance opens its Maintenance tab. You see the sections and buttons of your function: Finance has the money, the refunds and the deposit; Fleet the field jobs, the handovers and the car&#39;s rates; customer service the review and offer, changes and extensions; Sales the requests and offers.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Write a <b class="gd-ui">Subject</b> and a <b class="gd-ui">Message</b>, or pick a <b class="gd-ui">Quick reply</b> to start from.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Email the renter</b>. It goes from CarmaCars and the renter can answer in their account; the answer opens a task for customer service.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">On a booking an insurer pays you can choose Blind Spot Car Rental (insurance) as the sender, and <b class="gd-ui">Email the adjuster</b> writes to the adjuster on the booking.</div></li></ol></div><p class="gd-p">The tab lists the messages both ways and every email of the booking with its state. Each email counts against the daily email limit, shown under the form.</p><h3 class="gd-h3">Find a booking</h3><p class="gd-p"><b class="gd-ui">Bookings</b>: type at least 3 characters of the booking number (CC-1042, 1042), the renter&#39;s or a driver&#39;s name, an email, a phone number, a plate or a car code, then press Enter. <b class="gd-ui">My bookings</b> lists yours, with your commission. Every search is logged, as Find a renter.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="shared-tools-phone-alerts" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Phone alerts</h2><p class="gd-p">Get an alert on your phone or computer for new requests, replies to answer and urgent problems, even with the portal closed.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open <b class="gd-ui">Profile</b> (top of the menu). Under <b class="gd-ui">Phone alerts</b>, press <b class="gd-ui">Turn on alerts</b> and allow notifications. The first page of the portal also offers it once.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Under <b class="gd-ui">What to alert me about</b>: new requests, booking changes and messages are on for staff; payments are off until you tick them.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">Send a test alert</b> checks the device. <b class="gd-ui">Remove</b> takes an old phone off.</div></li></ol></div><p class="gd-p">On an iPhone, add CarmaCars to the Home Screen first (Safari, <b class="gd-ui">Share</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Add to Home Screen</b>). Use your phone&#39;s own Focus or Do Not Disturb for quiet hours.</p><h3 class="gd-h3">Search</h3><p class="gd-p">The <b class="gd-ui">Search</b> button at the top of every page (or press <b class="gd-ui">/</b> where the page has no search box of its own) finds pages and the records your role may open: bookings and requests by number, renter name, email, phone or plate, renters, owners and cars.</p><h3 class="gd-h3">A VIN from the car</h3><p class="gd-p">VIN fields have <b class="gd-ui">Scan the barcode</b> (the barcode in the driver&#39;s door frame or under the windshield) and <b class="gd-ui">Photo of the VIN</b>. Check what was read against the car before saving.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="shared-tools-alerts-by-email" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Alerts by email</h2><p class="gd-p">Alerts that are not urgent come together in one email at most once an hour; urgent ones (a payment declined, documents to review for a pickup within 2 hours, the site down) still come on their own. Every alert is in the bell and on your phone at once. Choose on <b class="gd-ui">Profile</b>, Notifications: alerts by email, <b class="gd-ui">Change how often</b>: Hourly digest, Daily digest (07:00) or Off.</p><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Tip</span><div>To change the email you sign in with, open Profile, Sign-in and press <b class="gd-ui">Change my email</b>: type the new address, and we send a confirmation link to it and tell the old address. Your email changes only when the link is opened, and every record of yours follows it.</div></aside></section>');
select app.guide_release_section('field', 'start-here', 'start', null, '### Who this guide is for

CarmaCars field staff: drivers, detailers, and drivers who also detail. You hand cars over, take them back, move them and shoot listing photos. Everything is on your phone. Your jobs are under **Field work** in the staff portal; if you also hold another function (Sales, for example), its pages are in the same menu.

### What you need

- Your phone, charged, with a data connection (photos and signatures save as you take them)
- The invitation email from CarmaCars (the link works for 24 hours)
- A car charger and a cloth for the camera lens

## Your first sign-in

1. Open the invitation email on your phone and press its link within 24 hours. Choose a password and press **Save the new password**.
2. You land on **My jobs**. Next time, sign in at `carmacars.ca/sign-in` with your Email and Password.
3. In your browser''s menu, choose **Add to Home Screen**. The portal then opens full screen, like an app.
4. Open **Profile**, add your mobile number and press **Save my phone**.
5. At the top of the page, fill in your Home address and Postal code and press **Save my home address**. You need it before you add a rental or earn a commission.

![](/guides/img/field-04-profile-phone-f05000e2.jpg "phone; size: 390 920; pins: 4 92.3 78.3")

> Good to know: Recommended: on Profile, press **Set up two-step sign-in** and follow the steps with an authenticator app.

## Stuck on a page?

If you work on a page for a few minutes without anything saving, see the same error three times, or go back and forth between the same two steps, a small box asks **Need a hand with** the page. **Open the guide section** opens this guide at the right chapter in a sheet from the bottom of the screen; **Back to what I was doing** closes it and everything you typed is still there. **Open the Academy lesson** opens the lesson in a new tab. **Not now** quiets it on that page for a day. It never shows while a renter signs.', 'Start here', 'Who this is for and your first sign-in.',
  '### Who this guide is for

CarmaCars field staff: drivers, detailers, and drivers who also detail. You hand cars over, take them back, move them and shoot listing photos. Everything is on your phone. Your jobs are under **Field work** in the staff portal; if you also hold another function (Sales, for example), its pages are in the same menu.

### What you need

- Your phone, charged, with a data connection (photos and signatures save as you take them)
- The invitation email from CarmaCars (the link works for 24 hours)
- A car charger and a cloth for the camera lens

## Your first sign-in

1. Open the invitation email on your phone and press its link within 24 hours. Choose a password and press **Save the new password**.
2. You land on **My jobs**. Next time, sign in at `carmacars.ca/sign-in` with your Email and Password.
3. In your browser''s menu, choose **Add to Home Screen**. The portal then opens full screen, like an app.
4. Open **Profile**, add your mobile number and press **Save my phone**.
5. At the top of the page, fill in your Home address and Postal code and press **Save my home address**. You need it before you add a rental or earn a commission.

![](/guides/img/field-04-profile-phone-f05000e2.jpg "phone; size: 390 920; pins: 4 92.3 78.3")

> Good to know: Recommended: on Profile, press **Set up two-step sign-in** and follow the steps with an authenticator app.

## Stuck on a page?

If you work on a page for a few minutes without anything saving, see the same error three times, or go back and forth between the same two steps, a small box asks **Need a hand with** the page. **Open the guide section** opens this guide at the right chapter in a sheet from the bottom of the screen; **Back to what I was doing** closes it and everything you typed is still there. **Open the Academy lesson** opens the lesson in a new tab. **Not now** quiets it on that page for a day. It never shows while a renter signs.

> Good to know: When we update our terms of use, our privacy policy or an agreement you signed with us, the next time you open your portal it shows **We''ve updated our terms**: a short summary of what changed and the new text. Tick that you read it and press **Accept** to continue. It does not change an agreement you already signed or a past booking.',
  '<h3 class="gd-h3">Who this guide is for</h3><p class="gd-p">CarmaCars field staff: drivers, detailers, and drivers who also detail. You hand cars over, take them back, move them and shoot listing photos. Everything is on your phone. Your jobs are under <b class="gd-ui">Field work</b> in the staff portal; if you also hold another function (Sales, for example), its pages are in the same menu.</p><h3 class="gd-h3">What you need</h3><ul class="gd-ul"><li>Your phone, charged, with a data connection (photos and signatures save as you take them)</li><li>The invitation email from CarmaCars (the link works for 24 hours)</li><li>A car charger and a cloth for the camera lens</li></ul><section class="gd-task" id="start-here-your-first-sign-in" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Your first sign-in</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--side"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open the invitation email on your phone and press its link within 24 hours. Choose a password and press <b class="gd-ui">Save the new password</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">You land on <b class="gd-ui">My jobs</b>. Next time, sign in at <span class="gd-url">carmacars.ca/sign-in</span> with your Email and Password.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">In your browser&#39;s menu, choose <b class="gd-ui">Add to Home Screen</b>. The portal then opens full screen, like an app.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Open <b class="gd-ui">Profile</b>, add your mobile number and press <b class="gd-ui">Save my phone</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">5</span><div class="gd-t">At the top of the page, fill in your Home address and Postal code and press <b class="gd-ui">Save my home address</b>. You need it before you add a rental or earn a commission.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/920"><img src="/guides/img/field-04-profile-phone-f05000e2.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="920"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:92.3%;top:78.3%" aria-hidden="true">4</span></div></div></figure></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Good to know</span><div>Recommended: on Profile, press <b class="gd-ui">Set up two-step sign-in</b> and follow the steps with an authenticator app.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="start-here-stuck-on-a-page" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Stuck on a page?</h2><p class="gd-p">If you work on a page for a few minutes without anything saving, see the same error three times, or go back and forth between the same two steps, a small box asks <b class="gd-ui">Need a hand with</b> the page. <b class="gd-ui">Open the guide section</b> opens this guide at the right chapter in a sheet from the bottom of the screen; <b class="gd-ui">Back to what I was doing</b> closes it and everything you typed is still there. <b class="gd-ui">Open the Academy lesson</b> opens the lesson in a new tab. <b class="gd-ui">Not now</b> quiets it on that page for a day. It never shows while a renter signs.</p><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Good to know</span><div>When we update our terms of use, our privacy policy or an agreement you signed with us, the next time you open your portal it shows <b class="gd-ui">We&#39;ve updated our terms</b>: a short summary of what changed and the new text. Tick that you read it and press <b class="gd-ui">Accept</b> to continue. It does not change an agreement you already signed or a past booking.</div></aside></section>');
select app.guide_release_section('field', 'my-jobs', 'chapter', 'start-here', 'Your day, in order: handovers, returns, deliveries, moves and photo shoots. Each job card has the car, the plate, the place and the time.

## Your job list

1. The menu: **My jobs**, **Cars now**, **Map** (where the cars of your jobs are now, with their trips and alerts), **My hours** and **Me** (My sales, Referrals, Profile and Academy, as a row on top). **Add a rental** and **Report a problem** are buttons at the top of My jobs. **Sign out** is top right.
2. Switch between **Today** and **Tomorrow**. Jobs are in time order.
3. The next job is the big card at the top: its time and how long until it, the car and its plate, the place with **Open in maps** and a button to call the renter, and what to put in the car. The rest of the day follows in time order.
4. A handover or a return has its own button: **Check out (pickup)** or **Check in (return)**. One tap acknowledges and starts the job and opens its photo checklist. Other jobs: press **Open the job**.
5. Moving a car that has no job? Use Vehicle moves (see below).

![](/guides/img/field-01-today-phone-b31e25fb.jpg "phone; size: 390 1530; pins: 1 91.0 15.0, 2 89.7 53.3, 3 89.7 61.4, 4 89.7 88.2")

> Tip: Need help on a job? Call CarmaCars at 289-312-5991. The link is at the bottom of My jobs.

## Open a job

1. The card shows the kind, the time, the car, the plate and colour.
2. The address, with **Open in maps** for directions, and a button to call the renter.
3. For a handover: the booking, the renter''s name and phone, the Card on File and the licence on file.
4. Press **Acknowledge** so the office knows you have it. Then press **Start** when you are with the car.

![](/guides/img/field-02-job-phone-c6780f54.jpg "phone; size: 390 1530; pins: 1 94.9 34.0, 2 94.9 44.1, 3 94.9 52.6, 4 94.9 95.8")

## Check the renter''s licence

The renter''s licence photos and selfie are checked before the handover. You can check them yourself, for a booking on one of your own jobs today or in the next 7 days. Everything you do is recorded with your name and "field staff".

1. My jobs shows **Licences to check** when the licence front, back or selfie of a renter on one of your jobs waits for a decision. The same check is on the job itself, under **Check the licence**.
2. Press **Review the licence**. The images open with the name, date of birth and licence details on the booking.
3. Look at each image and the licence reader''s lines under each driver (Pass or Flag: valid to the return, class, age, name and date of birth, the Ontario number, front and back): no sign of alteration, and the selfie matches the licence photo. A photo you take that is blurry or cut off says so at once: take it again.
4. One is wrong? Open **Reject this one** under it, type the reason the renter reads and press **Reject**. The renter is told why and sends a new one.
5. Then press **Approve all**: everything still waiting is approved at once.

> Tip: The renter''s proof of coverage stays with the office. Meeting the renter at the handover? You can still check the original licence in person from the ready check (see A handover).

## Move a car

1. Under Vehicle moves, press **Start a move**. Choose the Car and Why (for example Reposition).
2. Fill in From and the Odometer (km), then press **Start the move now**.
3. When you arrive, press **End the move**, fill in Now at and the odometer, then press **End the move now**.

## Documents to sign

Your staff agreement, when CarmaCars sends it.

1. My jobs shows "You have a document to sign". Press **Read and sign**.
2. Check the key values at the top (your role, wage and start date), then press **Read the PDF** and read it.
3. Sign in a few steps: press **Send the code** and type the 6-digit code from your phone or email, tick that you read it, draw your initials beside the key terms (confidentiality, the rules on money, keys and cars, ending the agreement), tick the two consents and draw your signature.
4. Press **Sign**. The signed copy, with its certificate of completion, stays on the same page.

## Cars now

**Field work** > **Cars now** shows which cars are out, coming back today and tomorrow, going out in the next 72 hours and free, with no money. The renter''s phone shows only on your own jobs.


## Call and text the renter

**Call** on a job opens the Quo app with the renter''s number, so the call comes from the CarmaCars number; **Text** opens a small window that sends from the CarmaCars number and keeps the text with the booking. Without the Quo app, use **Use this phone** in the window that opens.

**Search:** the **Search** button at the top finds your jobs by booking number, plate or car.', 'My jobs', 'Your job list, a job card, maps and car moves.',
