  '<p class="gd-p">Report anything that happens on the road, add a rental for a renter you found, share your referral link, and keep your details up to date.</p><section class="gd-task" id="report-rentals-referrals-and-profile-report-a-problem" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Report a problem</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--side"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open <b class="gd-ui">Report a problem</b> and choose the Car.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Choose What happened: <b class="gd-ui">New damage found</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Warning light</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Collision while I was driving</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Ticket or toll while I was driving</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Lost property found</b> or <b class="gd-ui">Something else</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Write the Details: where, when and what you see.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Take a photo</b> for each photo, then <b class="gd-ui">Send the report</b>.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--phone"><div class="gd-phone"><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:390/1040"><img src="/guides/img/field-03-report-phone-3b903b20.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="390" height="1040"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:93.6%;top:46.6%" aria-hidden="true">1</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:93.6%;top:64.9%" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:93.6%;top:89.9%" aria-hidden="true">3</span></div></div></figure></div><aside class="gd-box gd-box--warn"><span class="gd-lbl">Watch out</span><div>In a collision, make sure everyone is safe and call 911 if anyone is hurt. Then call CarmaCars at 289-312-5991 before you send the report.</div></aside></section><section class="gd-task" id="report-rentals-referrals-and-prof